{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و\n \n けやき坂46 2期生 丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD0QYFW2GS19NDHJ81N2E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n いぇーい！\n \n 最近メロンパンの美味しさに気づきました！\n \n 今まではあんまり好んで食べたことがなくて…\n \n でもここ最近食べるようになって、ああ、美味しい！😍となってます(^^)\n \n \n メロンパンブーム来そうです！笑\n \n \n でも毎日1.5L以上お水飲むよう頑張るぞ！\n \n \n ブログに書いた以上、やるしか！ということで 笑\n なんだか頑張れそうです！ゴクゴク飲むぞ〜！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD1PV0KDM4G4XAKTWQTRQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD2P3KAZ1HF8AB6V24KP2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ペットボトルのキャップにストローが付いていて市販のストローをつけて便利なものに！🧸\n \n 初めて出会ったときはなんて便利なグッズなのだ！😳と感動しました！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD3N8F21MKDDAW3ZPYF73","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ひよたん！！！寝てる！！笑\n 可愛い😍\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD4KBCFE2S0WQ3W19D8EQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n パチクリ👀起きてます！笑\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD5J01ZBXBDJS9FKHNNDZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n やあ！✋\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD6H2KH0XBGR1Q98XJQXF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ピース✌️\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD7GKZMQ5BMZ77JP1GFXX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 気をためてます 笑\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3KD8GEWPB4CPN5GFY3P0TW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 放っていますね！笑\n はーーーーっ！！！！\n \n きんちゃん(みく)が撮ってくれました〜！\n よくお世話になっています…ありがとう😭\n \n \n \n \n 読んでいただきありがとうございました\n \n #132"}],"source":"archive"}